Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pesci, what the hell\Nare you doing? Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this train right now, Pesci!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stop this train!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.74,0:01:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.74,0:01:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know the first\Nthing about stopping trains!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,In a matter of moments, you and\Nyour power will be but a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, I'll save my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.76,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll keep protecting Trish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.14,0:02:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let this prick\Ntake you away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.88,0:02:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.79,0:02:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That was marvelous work, Pessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.76,0:02:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your quick-fire thinking\Nprevented a nasty end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a close one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He was almost a goner, but I\Nsnagged him at the last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that he's on my hook,\Nhe's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But it feels like I've got two bodies\Ndangling off the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.36,0:02:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be Pucurati.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't bite it when they fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a formidable adversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My life started to flash\Nbefore my eyes just then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:02:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I said something to the\Neffect of you being a lousy capo,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but I take it all back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.86,0:03:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That was said in poor taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.08,0:03:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now you make decisions\Nwith a fair and impartial eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your crew's lives are\Nas valuable as your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The more we duke it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the more apparent it is\Nthe boss was right to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,leave his estranged daughter\Nin your capable hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you've left quite\Na strong impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Bucciarati, your\Nluck as a capo just ran out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so eager to leap\Nfrom this train before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy your ride\Nto the afterlife. Superman!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.76,0:03:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My aging powers are still thrusting\Nyou into an early retirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your younger brother's freaky\Nfishing line, my life has been spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.49,0:03:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't aiming for me in the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I be the unlucky one in all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at what happened with Meester.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle he still has a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I unloaded three bullets\Nstraight into his skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,yet somehow the stronzo\Nis still drawing breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if the sun suddenly\Nstarted rising in the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him everything he needs to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.96,0:04:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The energy from an attack\Ndealt on the fishing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,line goes straight back\Nto the one on the hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.03,0:04:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,My load just got a hell of a lot lighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I lost that douche, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, Prosciutto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We slaughtered that punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.06,0:04:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,His age acceleration\Nis finally wearing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.94,0:04:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we just have to finish\Noff loser hook. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.51,0:04:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know for a fact that I\Nhooked Big Bro's right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.28,0:04:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm positive there was\Nnothing else on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.26,0:05:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,His pinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was on the\Nright side of the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.74,0:05:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The pinky's on the left side of the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.94,0:05:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but how is that possible how'd\Ni hook the left hand what the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.26,0:05:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,heck is going on here something\Nweird's happening out there why
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.14,0:05:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,is my big bro's left hand hooked\Nnow would someone make this
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,weird shit make sense because i'm\Nfreaking the f out here although
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,now that i think about it big\Nbro did feel a teeny bit heavier
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,than normal hey you with the\Nfishing ball you gotta hit the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,emergency brakes this entire train\Nhas been infected all the aches
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And pains are gone, but something\Nstill doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.35,0:05:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.62,0:05:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the driver to stop the\Ntrain before we all bite it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.16,0:05:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If all these people are\Nstarting to get better,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,then the body that dropped\Nfrom my line must have been...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh God, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way it was him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.26,0:05:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Big Bro, please no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:05:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm talking here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention or we're\Nall gonna die, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro, for shoot,\Ndon't say it as it's so!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.94,0:06:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's not around, those guys will come\Nout of the turtle and that's it for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.19,0:06:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying like a damn baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Make somebody stop the train, strunzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Drinking Mamoni, out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.58,0:06:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't do anything to help,\NI'll just have to do it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.94,0:06:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.85,0:06:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The aging hasn't stopped after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Not again. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:07:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, they will die. Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like always, you\Nwere absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.34,0:07:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've caught your target,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.26,0:07:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,your only priority is to hold\Non to them no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to keep your stand activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,even if it means you end\Nup losing an arm or a leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.48,0:07:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,With the state he's in, he\Nwon't survive much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of time\Nbefore he takes his last breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and still he refuses\Nto withdraw his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and a warrior till the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to complete our mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to capture Trish\Nwhatever the personal cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, big bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come too close to the\Nfinish line to turn back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, prosciutto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You taught me true bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't just hear your words now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel them in the depths of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like you\Nalways told me, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,When the dark dot comes,\Nthe deed is already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.30,0:08:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking life doesn't feel half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't nearly as scary as\NI thought it was going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that, my days of\Nbeing called Mamoni are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll be the pitiless\Npesci of death feared by all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put an end to\Nyou once and for all while
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,my big bro's powers still\Nhave a little potency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.11,0:08:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta get that Hulk out\Nof you before he retaliates!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you unzipped your hand, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.75,0:09:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this freak somehow have a way of\Nanticipating every move that I make?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can read you like a picture book.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My hook's itching to get\Ninside and rip you apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and your wrist is too good\Nan entry point to pass up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The hook's shooting up your\Narm like a bat out of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.04,0:09:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd it slip out again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.28,0:09:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Merda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.19,0:09:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I go to pull it out, he anticipates\Nall my movements to the centimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost your mind if you think\NI'll let you get away from me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never let Big Bro Spirit die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll snatch up Trish and complete\Nthe mission in his honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vucerati!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.97,0:09:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The dipshit's down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.44,0:09:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If we get rid of that guy, Juno and\Nthe other guys will go back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, they can take down Polpo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to get a helping of the\Ntorment and anguish my Big Thro suffered!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Asshole must have grabbed on to something,\Nwhich would mean that he's climbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.52,0:10:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're heading right for the power lines!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.96,0:10:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,what's going on here I felt\Nsomething hit but it didn't feel
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,like a body being bisected I\Nfeel the vibrations of a pulse
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.44,0:10:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati is definitely still\Nalive he got himself back inside
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the train the way things are
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,shaking out we'll have to take
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,down this bastard face to\Nface you're right but we don't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:11:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,have the means not like this\Nwe've run out of time the hook is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.30,0:11:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,already burrowing into my chest\Ncavity my hook is 12 centimeters
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,away from your heart whoops make\Nthat 11 i misjudged terribly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the thug with the aging\Npowers was formidable
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but i see now he was never\Nour greatest threat the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.62,0:11:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,real terror on the train\Nwas hidden behind that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,innocuous tool what are you\Nplanning to do Bucciarati,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,that hook will skewer your\Nheart before too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.14,0:11:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine away, eight away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.54,0:11:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll have to teach him a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to overcome his stand
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.94,0:11:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,is to make this Collione\Nunderstand something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.46,0:11:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I have Determinazione in spades.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Zippermen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:12:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a hint of a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't sense any breathing either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so confused!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd I completely lose track of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're starting to worry me, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we don't have a lot of\Noptions, but this is too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet yourself, number six.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.79,0:12:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We must wait till he leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Acts like this are what it means to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.44,0:12:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Determinazione.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, he's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His stand lets him slip off\Nmy hook whenever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He could ambush me from any angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I gotta pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Paranoia is a sign of mental weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what Prosciutto would tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Be confident, Pesci.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone can find a hidden heartbeat\Non this speeding death trap from hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,it's you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.40,0:12:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Bucciarati is\Nas mobile as he used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.10,0:13:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet big money that cowardly bastard\Nwas hiding out somewhere near my hawk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.86,0:13:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The line!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.06,0:13:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He's making it even longer now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to put yourself\Nback together and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.92,0:13:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.32,0:13:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He still can't tell where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And it'll stay that way, as long\Nas I remain perfectly still.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I have to stay motionless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.32,0:13:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That proves my resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen for the blood\Ncoursing through his veins,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.16,0:13:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,find his beating heart, and destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.24,0:13:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not the one I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The weight's all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the tourist!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fate, but there's no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.68,0:13:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's zeroed in on your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:13:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mujerati!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.68,0:14:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You said all you were\Ngonna do was stay still,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,not cleave your heart in\Nhalf to stop the vibrations!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Has he lost his mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can live for very long if their\Nheart and lungs don't work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.76,0:14:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is silent\Nas a freaking cemetery!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Slippery Katsone must have snuck off\Nsomewhere with that zipper of his!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You've taken this too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.42,0:14:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this bastard hiding now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.29,0:14:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what if that Gazzone Bucciarati\Nreally finished off prosciutto?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.66,0:14:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If my bro's stand is gone, then the\Nguys in the turtle will be after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.08,0:14:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:14:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw this noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You messed with the wrong guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor idiot gave up and left!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.52,0:15:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That Determinazione of yours totally\Nthrew the doof off the trail!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure as hell showed\Nthat guy who's boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and zip\Nyour body back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.34,0:15:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get a move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange life is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.96,0:15:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.06,0:15:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Controlling bullets is\Nthe most I'm able to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not strong enough to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.76,0:15:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,His drive got me totally\Noff-guard, so he's the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.22,0:15:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't this train stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.96,0:15:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a train ride from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,One that I would not have survived\Nwithout some luck on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm happy to say the\Njourney led me right to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll suffer for what\Nyou've done, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.54,0:16:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah for determinazione!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing my big bro sees before he
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,dies will be your corpse\Nthrown into the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.20,0:16:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider me impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:16:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some sharp peepers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:16:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,His eyes look like they've\Nwitnessed years of bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,His composure is downright menacing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple tricks aren't going\Nto work on him. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Glory is yours for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off, Pesci.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.82,0:17:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My time has come, but I'll be\Nwatching you from the next life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.92,0:17:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.64,0:17:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll avenge my bro with your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.70,0:17:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's such a predictable move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.42,0:17:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shooting straight up the arm to the\Ncardiac muscle was always my go-to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that was when I didn't have\Nthe balls to try anything riskier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But now my finisher is an assault\Nstraight to the heart of my prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing will stop me from steamrolling\Nyour brother-killing ass into extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.90,0:18:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rip your heart out and\Ntear it into a million pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You should save the\Nvictory speech until after.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.72,0:18:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you've won the fight\Nthat's how a true mafiosi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it before I play my ultimate head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.40,0:18:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,go ahead take her
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.86,0:18:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and run right now and
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.50,0:18:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let her keep her life look he's got\Nthe turtle what where I'm not gonna make
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.42,0:18:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It but before I go, the least I can do is\Ngive you a little parting gift. The gift
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.50,0:19:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,of knowing you failed your familia now\Nwatch as i crush this thing into turtle's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.64,0:19:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the rest of the group is gonna be smashed\Nto death you know i admired that glint
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,in your eyes there was an unrelenting\Nnobility to them you don't see that very
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,often pity it's vanished now you're
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.58,0:19:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing but a disgraced swine am i now i
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.56,0:19:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,disagree the only Everyone's falling for\Ngrace of your friends in this damn turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.10,0:19:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy burning in hell, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.46,0:19:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell you've lived life\Nas the eternal screw-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't change on my account.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrivederci.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fairly obvious we can't\Ntravel by train from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what they know\Nand who they've told about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.94,0:20:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they've figured out where we're\Ngoing by now, and what the Turtle can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to use another form\Nof transportation from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I'd like to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to cooperate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have authorization to do\Nsuch a thing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.50,0:20:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,our mission is only to\Nsafeguard your life you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:20:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,will answer my questions\Ntell me just who am i
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,really what the hell is\Nthis how did it get on
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the ground i want answers\Nwhy are these bizarre
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.76,0:21:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,marks appearing near my\Nfeet how did a father
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.68,0:21:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,i've never even met turn\Nme into a walking target
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought, the Boss's\Ndaughter is a Stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's currently 6:34 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.54,0:21:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I arrived at the scene 20\Nminutes after the train stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.84,0:21:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Prosciutto is dead next to the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Pesci has been mutilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The pieces are scattered\Nnear the riverbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.26,0:21:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging from the bloodbath here, this must\Nbe the work of Bucciaranti's Zipperman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about his team and the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.22,0:21:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you track him, Melone? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two disfigured losers actually\Nmanaged to do something useful for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.04,0:22:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a decent blood sample now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.00,0:22:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,From Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.66,0:22:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get you out of my\Nmind. Since you'll be all I
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.54,0:22:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,see I would give anything\NJust to make you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,me I don't give a damn\Nabout nothing else Freaking
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.64,0:22:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you is all I need I need
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.26,0:22:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,your body I need your body
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.90,0:23:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.90,0:23:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.64,0:23:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.78,0:23:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a freak in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.02,0:23:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.36,0:23:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.32,0:23:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.74,0:23:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. To show how much I'm a freak in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.90,0:23:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.90,0:24:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You
